                        <div class="text-bg">
                          <h1>What is a agriculture  robot?</h1>
                          <strong>The objective of agricultural robotics is to help the sector in its efficiency and in the profitability of the processes. In other words, mobile robotics works in the agricultural sector to improve productivity, specialization and environmental sustainability.</strong> </div>
